{"articleNo":"420656","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=420656&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [DB김준기문화재단] 71회 대학생 온라인 기업경영 체험스쿨 참가자 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.12.22","hit":"2924","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmwegRkgPBFAEgBQJoE9YBsByBVAGQBEAHdALwDNEB1AFQEMA6EgOwHMg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><br></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;layout-grid-mode:char;\nword-break:keep-all\"><br></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;layout-grid-mode:char\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\n&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:#0070C0\">■ 어떤 사람이 참여하면 좋나요<span lang=\"EN-US\">?<o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;layout-grid-mode:char\"><b><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">기업에 취직할\n때 도움이 될 대외활동을 하고싶어요<span lang=\"EN-US\">!<o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;layout-grid-mode:char\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\n&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">첫 대외활동으로 기업과 관련된 활동을 통해 여러 사람들과 교류하고 싶어요<span lang=\"EN-US\">!<o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;layout-grid-mode:char\"><b><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">기업에서 주관하는\n대외활동을 통해 기업경영과 실무에 대해 배우고 싶어요<span lang=\"EN-US\">!<o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;layout-grid-mode:char\"><b><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">재학생과 휴학생도\n학기 중 온라인으로 참여할 수 있는 대외활동을 찾고 있어요<span lang=\"EN-US\">!<o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;layout-grid-mode:char\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:#4472C4;\nmso-themecolor:accent1\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;layout-grid-mode:char\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\n&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:#0070C0\">■ 언제<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>어디서 하나요<span lang=\"EN-US\">?<o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:\nnormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp;</span>- </span></b><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:\nnormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">일시<span lang=\"EN-US\">:<span style=\"mso-tab-count:1\"> </span> 71</span>회 <span lang=\"EN-US\">1/18(</span>수<span lang=\"EN-US\">)~1/20(</span>금<span lang=\"EN-US\">) - 3</span>일<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:40.0pt;\nmso-char-indent-count:4.0;layout-grid-mode:char\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:\nnormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\ncolor:red\">(1</span></b><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\n&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:red\">일차<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 15:00~18:00 / 2,3</span>일차 <span lang=\"EN-US\">09:30~18:00)<span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-left:40.0pt;text-align:left;\ntext-indent:-40.0pt;layout-grid-mode:char\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:\n10.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp;</span>- </span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">대상<span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">기업체 취직을 희망하거나 기업 경영 활동에 관심이 있는 대학생</b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-left: 2.4em; text-align: left; text-indent: 40pt;\"><br></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;layout-grid-mode:char\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;\nmso-ascii-f